---
title: "getAcademicYear (stem-system members.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_date: today = new Date()
    q_date --> q_extract: year = today.getFullYear(), month = today.getMonth()
    q_extract --> q_check: month >= 3?
    q_check --> q_april: month >= 3
    q_april --> [*]: return year
    q_check --> q_jan: month < 3
    q_jan --> [*]: return year - 1

    note right of q_check
        INV-001: Academic year starts in April (month index 3)
        INV-002: January-March belong to the previous academic year
    end note
